Windows Defender Firewall blocks incoming ping requests by default.
A specific ICMPv4 Echo Request rule was added to allow ping from the local subnet.
	•	Protocol: ICMPv4
	•	Direction: Inbound
	•	ICMP Type: 8
	•	Remote Address: LocalSubnet
	•	Action: Allow
